      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think we actually need both a passthrough shader and a passthrough color-filter. I think we just need a passthrough color-filter. That is, we can just rename the \"passthrough shader\" to \"passthrough color-filter\".\n\nUnlike Ganesh, I\u0027m not doing anything where color filters are forced into one set of parameters, and shaders are forced into a different incompatible set. This added a lot of complexity and didn\u0027t really solve any problem. Passing an unused argument to a function is ~free and the inliner will happily eliminate it. ",
